WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,970 --> 00:00:03,970
You tricked us here on purpose

2
00:00:03,970 --> 00:00:05,970
You and your mother never considered me family

3
00:00:05,970 --> 00:00:07,970
If you don’t want to watch it, stop watching it.

4
00:00:07,970 --> 00:00:08,970
last life

5
00:00:08,970 --> 00:00:10,970
He killed me for Sun Yan and Tang Yang

6
00:00:10,970 --> 00:00:13,000
I thought he at least really loved them

7
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:15,000
But now he doesn't even dare to go out.

8
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:16,000
Just blame everyone

9
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:17,000
I still want to know

10
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Has he ever loved anyone?

11
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:19,000
my life

12
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:22,000
I was also pushed into loss by the person I trusted the most

13
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:24,000
The answer may not make you feel better

14
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:26,000
But if you must hear it with your own ears

15
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:27,000
Do you want me to bring them to you?

16
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:40,610
Not looking back randomly

17
00:00:40,610 --> 00:00:43,250
All they want is Jinghe's funeral
